---

<section class="idea-section home-gutter" aria-labelledby="idea-heading">
  <div class="idea-grid home-column">
    <p class="idea-marker">01 / The idea</p>
    <div class="idea-main">
      <h2 id="idea-heading" class="idea-heading">
        <span class="idea-heading-plain">Not a network.</span>
        <span class="idea-heading-accent">A neighborhood.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="idea-lede">
        The internet gave us reach. We are here for the closeness — the kind that makes it easier to ask a “silly” question, share a half-formed idea, or find the person who can help you take the next step.
      </p>
      <a class="idea-link" href="/about/">
        What we care about
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display';
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/playfairdisplay/v37/nuFrD-vYSZviVYUb_rj3ij__anPXDTlhI4VlFdGjZQ.woff2') format('woff2');
  }

  .idea-section {
    padding-top: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    background: var(--color-base-100);
    color: var(--color-base-content);
  }

  .idea-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .idea-marker {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .idea-heading {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .idea-heading-plain {
    color: var(--color-base-content);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .idea-heading-accent {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .idea-lede {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    max-width: 36rem;
    color: var(--color-base-content);
    opacity: 0.72;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .idea-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--color-base-content);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.35em;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  }

  .idea-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .idea-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .idea-section {
      padding-top: 4.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    .idea-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 9.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
      gap: 2rem 4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
